From 2548e56a57dd2a404241a27ff159060143d75524 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 04:36:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] docs: compile index, abstractions and types pages

FSharpPlus.Docs exists so the documentation never breaks, and it already compiles 64 of the
67 pages under docsrc/content. Three were outside both the explicit list and the type-*/
abstraction-* globs, so nothing checked them:

  index.fsx, abstractions.fsx, types.fsx

index.fsx is the front page and carries real examples, so it is the most-read page in the
corpus and the only substantial one the compiler never saw.

All three compile as-is; this only adds them to the project.
---
 src/FSharpPlus.Docs/FSharpPlus.Docs.fsproj | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/FSharpPlus.Docs/FSharpPlus.Docs.fsproj b/src/FSharpPlus.Docs/FSharpPlus.Docs.fsproj
index 69477d2..36bbab1 100644
--- a/src/FSharpPlus.Docs/FSharpPlus.Docs.fsproj
+++ b/src/FSharpPlus.Docs/FSharpPlus.Docs.fsproj
@@ -13,6 +13,15 @@
 
   <ItemGroup>
     <Compile Include="Samples\*.fsx" />
+    <Compile Include="..\..\docsrc\content\index.fsx">
+      <Link>Docs\%(FileName)%(Extension)</Link>	
+    </Compile>
+    <Compile Include="..\..\docsrc\content\abstractions.fsx">
+      <Link>Docs\%(FileName)%(Extension)</Link>	
+    </Compile>
+    <Compile Include="..\..\docsrc\content\types.fsx">
+      <Link>Docs\%(FileName)%(Extension)</Link>	
+    </Compile>
     <Compile Include="..\..\docsrc\content\applicative-functors.fsx">
       <Link>Docs\%(FileName)%(Extension)</Link>	
     </Compile>
